{"body":"The context menu for a backup was growing and was hard to scroll in. This PR replaces it with a new dialog that shows when clicking the additional commands button, making it more clear what you can do with a backup.\n\nSome texts and buttons on the database page were wrong for sync jobs and they are now fixed as well.","files":[{"path":"projects/ngclient/src/app/backup/database/database.component.html","additions":78,"deletions":66,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"projects/ngclient/src/app/backup/database/database.component.ts","additions":2,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"projects/ngclient/src/app/home/backup-actions-dialog/backup-actions-dialog.html","additions":33,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"projects/ngclient/src/app/home/backup-actions-dialog/backup-actions-dialog.scss","additions":110,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"projects/ngclient/src/app/home/backup-actions-dialog/backup-actions-dialog.spec.ts","additions":113,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"projects/ngclient/src/app/home/backup-actions-dialog/backup-actions-dialog.ts","additions":209,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"projects/ngclient/src/app/home/home.component.html","additions":15,"deletions":131,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"projects/ngclient/src/app/home/home.component.ts","additions":29,"deletions":9,"changeType":"MODIFIED"}],"headRefOid":"627789fab2c384822e5025ae5d6e9847a73af607","number":768,"title":"Larger context menu","url":"https://github.com/duplicati/ngclient/pull/768"}
